From: Kurt Himebauch <136133082+xXJSONDeruloXx@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] vkd3d: Report feature level 12_0 without Tiled Resources Tier 2.

Turnip exposes sparse 2D images only on Adreno 7xx gen3 and newer
(ubwc_all_formats_compatible), so the Adreno 740, 650 and older report no
tiled resources and stop at 11_1. Games that only ask for a 12_0 adapter,
such as Hades II and Kingdom Come: Deliverance II, then refuse to start.
Report 12_0 when the other 12_0 requirements hold. TiledResourcesTier is
not raised, so games that query it still see the real tier.
---
--- a/libs/vkd3d/device.c
+++ b/libs/vkd3d/device.c
@@ -9703,11 +9703,18 @@ static void d3d12_device_caps_init_feature_level(struct d3d12_device *device)
             vk_info->device_limits.maxPerStageDescriptorStorageImages >= D3D12_UAV_SLOT_COUNT)
         caps->max_feature_level = D3D_FEATURE_LEVEL_11_1;
 
+    /* Turnip only exposes sparse 2D images on Adreno 7xx gen3 and newer, so older Adreno GPUs
+     * report no tiled resources and would stop at 11_1. Games that only check for a 12_0 adapter
+     * then refuse to start. Report 12_0 without it; TiledResourcesTier stays truthful for games
+     * that query it. */
     if (caps->max_feature_level >= D3D_FEATURE_LEVEL_11_1 &&
-            caps->options.TiledResourcesTier >= D3D12_TILED_RESOURCES_TIER_2 &&
             caps->options.ResourceBindingTier >= D3D12_RESOURCE_BINDING_TIER_2 &&
             caps->options.TypedUAVLoadAdditionalFormats)
+    {
         caps->max_feature_level = D3D_FEATURE_LEVEL_12_0;
+        if (caps->options.TiledResourcesTier < D3D12_TILED_RESOURCES_TIER_2)
+            INFO("Reporting feature level 12_0 without Tiled Resources Tier 2.\n");
+    }
 
     if (caps->max_feature_level >= D3D_FEATURE_LEVEL_12_0 && caps->options.ROVsSupported &&
             caps->options.ConservativeRasterizationTier >= D3D12_CONSERVATIVE_RASTERIZATION_TIER_1)
